speakerId":null,"speakerName":"旅人","textMapHash":118802674,"text":"確かに色々あったね。","nextNodeIds":[100050204]},{"nodeId":100050204,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1018,"speakerName":"アルベド","textMapHash":2118303194,"text":"そうだね。でも、キミたちと騎士団のみんなが協力してくれたおかげで、無事解決できた。","nextNodeIds":[100050205]},{"nodeId":100050205,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1018,"speakerName":"アルベド","textMapHash":1072444266,"text":"それに、師匠が残した最後の課題もクリアできたんだ。","nextNodeIds":[100050206]},{"nodeId":100050206,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1018,"speakerName":"アルベド","textMapHash":4070965522,"text":"結果から見れば、これ以上ないくらい完璧だよ。","nextNodeIds":[100050207]},{"nodeId":100050207,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1018,"speakerName":"アルベド","textMapHash":3611663642,"text":"スクロースも最近、成長著しくてね。錬金に関わる多くの仕事を、一人でこなせるようになってきたんだ。","nextNodeIds":[100050208]},{"nodeId":100050208,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1018,"speakerName":"アルベド","textMapHash":111294674,"text":"騎士団のほうも、ボクが出ていく必要のある問題は特に抱えてない…","nextNodeIds":[100050209]},{"nodeId":100050209,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1018,"speakerName":"アルベド","textMapHash":1708569426,"text":"課題もなく、仕事もなく、面倒事もない…","nextNodeIds":[100050210,100050211]},{"nodeId":100050210,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_PLAYER","speakerId":null,"speakerName":"旅人","textMapHash":3148667522,"text":"どうしたの？","nextNodeIds":[100050212]},{"nodeId":100050212,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1018,"speakerName":"アルベド","textMapHash":1186702962,"text":"いや、なんでもないよ。たぶん毎日、頭を酷使する生活に慣れてしまったんだろうね…","nextNodeIds":[100050213]},{"nodeId":100050213,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1018,"speakerName":"アルベド","textMapHash":133235986,"text":"こうして完全に暇になると、正直、少し落ち着かないんだ。","nextNodeIds":[100050214]},{"nodeId":100050214,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1018,"speakerName":"アルベド","textMapHash":1684789242,"text":"無意識のうちに「まだ解決すべき問題が残ってるんじゃないか」って考えてしまう。","nextNodeIds":[100050215]},{"nodeId":100050215,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1018,"speakerName":"アルベド","textMapHash":3977383346,"text":"でも残念なことに、今のモンド城には、あらゆる問題に対して「完璧な解」が用意されてるようで…","nextNodeIds":[100050216]},{"nodeId":100050216,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1005,"speakerName":"パイモン","textMapHash":3611764050,"text":"ちょっとくらい休んだって、別にいいんじゃないか？毎日忙しくしてたら、身体が持たないぞ！","nextNodeIds":[100050217]},{"nodeId":100050217,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1005,"speakerName":"パイモン","textMapHash":3197683498,"text":"どうしても落ち着かないなら、オイラたちと一緒に遊びに行こうぜ！オイラ、サボり方にはめちゃくちゃ詳しいんだ！","nextNodeIds":[100050218]},{"nodeId":100050218,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1018,"speakerName":"アルベド","textMapHash":595996626,"text":"ハハッ、それならパイモンにしっかり教えてもらわないとね。","nextNodeIds":[100050219,100050220]},{"nodeId":100050219,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_PLAYER","speakerId":null,"speakerName":"旅人","textMapHash":2495127658,"text":"トラブルに巻き込まれたいなら…","nextNodeIds":[100050221]},{"nodeId":100050221,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1005,"speakerName":"パイモン","textMapHash":493180466,"text":"言うな、言うな！おまえがそういうこと言うと、毎回トラブルが——","nextNodeIds":[]},{"nodeId":100050220,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_PLAYER","speakerId":null,"speakerName":"旅人","textMapHash":1249087754,"text":"#{M#俺}{F#私}と一緒にいるといいよ…","nextNodeIds":[100050221]},{"nodeId":100050211,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_PLAYER","speakerId":null,"speakerName":"旅人","textMapHash":3726188858,"text":"新しいトラブル？","nextNodeIds":[100050212]}]},{"talkId":1000512,"talkConfig":{"checkActionAfter":false,"crowdLOD0List":[],"decoratorID":0,"disableTalkReview":false,"dontBlockDaily":false,"enableCameraDisplacement":false,"extraLoadMarkId":[],"finishExec":[{"param":["","","","",""],"type":"TALK_EXEC_NONE"},{"param":["","","","",""],"type":"TALK_EXEC_NONE"},{"param":["","","","",""],"type":"TALK_EXEC_NONE"},{"param":["","","","",""],"type":"TALK_EXEC_NONE"},{"param":["","","","",""],"type":"TALK_EXEC_NONE"}],"forceNpcNotDestroy":false,"heroRuleId":0,"ignoreDragonTalkRule":false,"isEnableNoBlackInter":false,"linkBehaviorGrpId":0,"loadType":"TALK_NORMAL_QUEST","lockGameTime":false,"lowPriority":false,"newTalkFinishTime":true,"onlyQuest